Readme Mailcow-26July2026 -ver0.73
=========================================


Bugs in this version :
==============================
After we setup the base infra , we must remove few dns entries :

nmcli connection show
sudo nmcli connection modify "ens192" ipv4.dns "172.16.1.10"

#execute below command in console not in ssh
sudo nmcli connection down "ens192"
sudo nmcli connection up "ens192"
or
sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager

Modify the mailcowconfig.conf before configuring mailcow and comment out either internal or external which
ever is not relevant .

How to use this package:?
================================

Intall Rocky Linux 9.7 [ not tested with 9.8]
 Select Server without GUI 
 create user demo 

1) 1_LinuxInfra-v0.7.3.zip
<<Exexute this in Console >>>>
      unzip LinuxInfra-v0.7.3.zip
        cd linuxinfra-v0.7.3/
       sudo ./LinuxInfra.sh

2) Modify the /etc/resolv.conf   [as explained above]

3) unzip MailcowBootstrap-v1.0.0.zip 
   cd MailcowBootstrap-v1.0.0/
   sudo bash ./MailcowBootstrap.sh

4) Comment either internal or external [ not tested without commenting ] 
unzip MailcowConfig-v1.0.0.zip
sudo ./MailcowConfig.sh

http://192.168.10.11 or http://192.168.10.12 
 admin / moohoo
How to reset password of Mailcow?
cd /opt/mailcow-dockerized
sudo ./helper-scripts/mailcow-reset-admin.sh


